{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#a0a0a0'> </div> !} Others: {!</td><td>!} [+ other_r +] % {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_other +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#004090'> </div> !} VS: {!</td><td>!} [+ vs_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_vs +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#F9DA00'> </div> !} NTS: {!</td><td>!} [+ nts_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_nts +] {!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

**Potential coalitions:**

Trudovaya Coalition (RSDRP + PSR + Other Leftists): [+ trudovaya_coalition +]%

Vremennyy Coalition (RSDRP + PSR + [+ musavat_name +] + K-D): [+ vremennyy_coalition +]%

Bourgeois Coalition (PSR + [+ musavat_name +] + K-D + Others): [+ bourgeois_coalition +]%

Right-wing Coalition (PSR + K-D + Others + VS): [+ right_coalition +]%

[? if nazi_urgency <= 1 and nts_r >= 15 : The rapid rise in NTS votes is extremely worrying. Many had believed that the party was moribund; now, some of us consider it to be the greatest threat to democracy in Germany. ?]

[? if anti_democratic_coalition >= 50 : Together, the anti-democratic RKP, PLSRI, VS, and NTS have a majority in the Reichstag. A stable governing majority will be almost impossible. ?]

There are some potential coalition arrangements.

@coalition_menu

- @rsdrp_majority
- @trudovaya_coalition
- @vremennyy_coalition
- @new_vremennyy_coalition
- @unity_government
